---
import {type Airport,price,traffic} from '../data/airports';
import {brandEditorial,planTradeoff} from '../data/brand-editorial';
import Promotion from './Promotion.astro';
import BrandPeers from './BrandPeers.astro';
import PlanSelector from './PlanSelector.astro';
import BrandEvidence from './BrandEvidence.astro';
import BrandDecision from './BrandDecision.astro';
const {airport:a}=Astro.props as {airport:Airport};const e=brandEditorial[a.slug];
---
<div class="article-layout dossier-layout"><article class="prose dossier"><BrandDecision airport={a} analysis/><BrandEvidence airport={a}/><h2 id="decision">第一步：确认这家是否匹配你的需求</h2><p>{a.recommendation}</p><p>{e.decision}</p><h2 id="budget">第二步：把容量需求换成月度预算</h2><p>{planTradeoff(a)}</p>{a.plans.length>0&&<><div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="决策分析引用的参考套餐"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">收录档位</th><th scope="col">原始周期价格</th><th scope="col">标称容量</th></tr></thead><tbody>{a.plans.map(p=><tr><th scope="row">{p.name}</th><td>{price(p)}</td><td>{traffic(p)}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><PlanSelector airport={a}/></>}<p>这里只比较公开参考档的月付预算，不把年费摊销当成月付，也不在倍率未知时生成实际每 GB 成本。</p><h2 id="tradeoff">第三步：判断方案优点是否对你有用</h2><div class="fit-grid"><section class="fit-panel"><span class="fit-label">可以支持的判断</span><ul>{a.advantages.map(text=><li>{text}</li>)}</ul></section><section class="fit-panel caution"><span class="fit-label">不能据此推导</span><p>容量、付款周期与预算结构，不能推导出速度、隐私保护、晚高峰表现或指定应用可用性。本站未开展这些实测。</p></section></div><h2 id="risks">第四步：先处理品牌特有的疑点</h2><div class="editor-note caution"><strong>资料里最需要澄清的地方</strong><p>{a.sourceNotes}</p></div><p>{a.purchaseCheck}</p><h2 id="alternatives">把相近预算的候选放在一起核对</h2><BrandPeers airport={a}/><h2 id="action">确认条件后，再查看当前套餐</h2><Promotion airport={a}/><p>品牌和展示顺序由站长指定，链接含推广关系。当前结算、优惠条款与设备支持应在跳转后的面板中确认。</p><h2 id="sources">分析依据与资料边界</h2><p>本页是基于套餐参考的编辑判断，不是使用体验或测速报告。引用查询于 {a.lastVerified}，没有注册付款或确认到账。</p><div class="source-cards">{a.sources.map((url,i)=><a href={url} rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>引用 {i+1}</span><strong>{new URL(url).hostname}</strong><small>查看公开资料 ↗</small></a>)}</div><div class="dossier-next"><a class="button detail-button" href={`/airport/${a.slug}/`}>查看完整品牌档案 →</a><a class="button secondary" href="/compare/">打开机场对比</a></div></article><aside class="sidebar"><div class="sidebar-inner"><h2>购买决策路径</h2>{[['overview','选择摘要'],['evidence','本次资料核对'],['decision','需求是否匹配'],['budget','容量与预算'],['tradeoff','方案优点'],['risks','关键疑点'],['alternatives','比较替代方案'],['action','当前套餐入口'],['sources','依据与来源']].map(([id,label])=><a href={`#${id}`}>{label}</a>)}</div></aside></div>
